<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 14:11:30 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>日元上涨，因猜测美国支持后将采取更多干预措施</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/yen-rises-amid-speculation-of-more-intervention-after-u-s-support/</link><description>在东京早盘交易中，日元兑美元汇率从小幅下跌转为上涨 1.4%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2288088220-e1785764729254.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:45:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/yen-rises-amid-speculation-of-more-intervention-after-u-s-support/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普表示伊朗协议即将达成后，油价暴跌，股指期货飙升</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/oil-tumbles-and-stock-futures-surge-after-trump-said-iran-deal-was-near/</link><description>布伦特原油下跌 4.9%，至 83.66 美元，美国原油下跌 5.8%，至 79.81 美元，道指期货在周一开盘前上涨 1.1%，而亚洲市场下跌。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2268295164-e1785761391697.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:44:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/oil-tumbles-and-stock-futures-surge-after-trump-said-iran-deal-was-near/</guid></item><item><title>贝森特拒绝华尔街对美国债券销售的指导</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/bessent-wall-street-rebuff-debt-sales-forward-guidance/</link><description>大多数交易商认为，财政部重申，预计“至少在未来几个季度”不会增加票据和债券发行。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287747676.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:43:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/bessent-wall-street-rebuff-debt-sales-forward-guidance/</guid></item><item><title>国会现在需要一个人工智能框架</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/congress-needs-an-ai-framework-now/</link><description>美国需要一个联邦人工智能框架，原因很简单：没有人知道界限在哪里。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2213401289-e1785589025175.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/congress-needs-an-ai-framework-now/</guid></item><item><title>如果政府真的使用 SpaceAI，它可能成为东南亚对抗厄尔尼诺现象的优势</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/spaceai-could-be-southeast-asias-edge-against-el-nino-if-governments-actually-use-it/</link><description>SpaceAI——人工智能 (AI) 和空间技术的融合——可以帮助东南亚将原始数据转化为拯救生命等成果。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-2235383074-e1785518632344.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 04:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/02/spaceai-could-be-southeast-asias-edge-against-el-nino-if-governments-actually-use-it/</guid></item><item><title>美国对稀土的 5 亿美元赌注取决于新罕布什尔州的一家小型炼油厂在 2 年内将产量从 200 公斤扩大到 120 吨</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/phoenix-tailings-rare-earth-refinery-new-hampshire-pentagon/</link><description>导弹库存的耗尽和 7 月 20 日的采购禁令正在推动 Phoenix Tailings 和 Arnold Magnetic 等公司扩大生产规模。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26211844941047-e1785762150253.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:09:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/phoenix-tailings-rare-earth-refinery-new-hampshire-pentagon/</guid></item><item><title>软银、日立、LG 支持 Zenity 向警察 AI 代理提供 1.25 亿美元融资</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/softbank-hitachi-lg-back-zenitys-125-million-round-to-police-ai-agents/</link><description>本轮融资正值亚洲企业争先恐后地部署人工智能代理，用首席执行官本·克里格(Ben Kliger)的话来说，这些代理触及“企业的各个方面”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Zenity-Founders-Credit-to-Eyal-Toueg-e1785605201380.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/softbank-hitachi-lg-back-zenitys-125-million-round-to-police-ai-agents/</guid></item><item><title>截至 2026 年 7 月 31 日的当前油价</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-07-31-2026/</link><description>当油价变化时，它会影响您的能源成本，甚至日常用品的价格。原因如下。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Price-of-Oil-July-31.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 10:45:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/price-of-oil-07-31-2026/</guid></item><item><title>“日本对我们非常好，当然，珍珠港事件除外”：特朗普尴尬地拯救日元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/trump-pearl-harbor-yen-intervention-japan/</link><description>在最罕见的市场走势之后，美元从 40 年来的高点暴跌：特朗普将联合干预伪装成朋友之间的恩惠。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26215077709077-e1785761746657.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:56:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/trump-pearl-harbor-yen-intervention-japan/</guid></item><item><title>一夜之间有人闯入列支敦士登的秘密财富天堂名单</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/liechtenstein-cyberattack-beneficial-owners-register/</link><description>隔夜的网络攻击袭击了列支敦士登的反洗钱登记册，暴露了这个只有 40,000 名居民的国家的受益所有人。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26215236543416-e1785760918158.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:42:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/03/liechtenstein-cyberattack-beneficial-owners-register/</guid></item></channel></rss>